{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS8zvyHDBaKHeyjbwMP7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`save_fact` no longer evicts the static instructions from the prompt cache. The fix is in `build_system()` in `bot.py`, and ANSWER.md explains the cause and the change.\n\n**Cause:** the coaching rules and the athlete's facts sat in one block with one `cache_control` marker. Each `save_fact` changed that block, so the next call wrote a new cache entry for the whole prompt. `logs/usage.jsonl` shows this: the call after each save has `cache_read_input_tokens: 0`.\n\n**Change:** the system prompt is now two blocks.\n1. The static `INSTRUCTIONS`, cached. These are identical for every athlete and day, so a save leaves them alone.\n2. The per-athlete context (facts, zones, date), uncached, so it can change freely.\n\nThe tools list is unchanged by `save_fact`, so it stays cached too.\n\n**Verification:** an offline test with a fake LLM confirmed that a save round sends an identical cached block, that the new fact appears only in the uncached block, and that the tools list is the same across rounds. I did not call the live API, so the real cache hit rate is still unconfirmed.\n\n**Check after deploy:** the cacheable prefix is tools plus instructions. I estimate the instructions at about 620 tokens, and the logged prefix was about 1090 tokens including tools. That should clear the 1024-token minimum, but if it doesn't, caching silently won't happen. Confirm that `cache_read_input_tokens` is non-zero on later calls, including the round after a save.\n\nI left `MODEL` (`claude-sonnet-4-5`) and the keyword-based tool filtering alone. That filtering still changes the tools list on some messages and invalidates the cache for those calls, as NOTES.md already records."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1166,"cache_read_input_tokens":34367,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1166},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"831edd8e-2993-453c-be2b-e7ce3ea50d37","uuid":"afc70bc0-343d-4ca4-96a6-59e7eb87975d","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:49:41.119Z","request_id":"req_011CgS8zviu8D41iwwD1BDR6"}
